Completion API 
 
The Completion API for the current completion record.  This must be a 14-digit API.  If less than 14 digits, then 0’s will be added to the end of the number and if more than 14 digits are input the first 14 will be truncated and only that value will be used. Must be used with the “Well Num” import token to trigger the record.
 

